
sequenceDiagram
    participant N as TuiNavigator
    participant C as MainMenuController
    participant V as MainMenuView
    participant U as User
    participant S as SettingsController

    N->>C: Create controller
    N->>C: show()
    C->>V: render()
    V-->>U: Display menu
    U->>C: Input "2"
    C->>C: handleInput("2")
    C->>N: showSettings()
    N->>S: Create SettingsController
    N->>S: show()